    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, why would it be bad exactly? i mean its just a plant and the pill is just hormones, i don't see how they'd really mess with each other that much. i don't really want to switch my birth control if i don't have to. can i just take a small dose of the st johns wort and it'll be fine?",
